{"seq":1,"slug":"feedback-fundamentals","title":"反馈基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/feedback-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feedback-models-frameworks","title":"反馈模型与框架","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/feedback-fundamentals/feedback-models-frameworks","wordCount":2056,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"giving-receiving-feedback","title":"给予与接收反馈的实战技术","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/feedback-fundamentals/giving-receiving-feedback","wordCount":2279,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"radical-candor-practice","title":"极度坦诚实践","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/feedback-fundamentals/radical-candor-practice","wordCount":1986,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 反馈基础\n\n反馈是管理者影响他人行为的最小单元。本章建立反馈的认知框架与交付能力：从结构化模型（SBI、COIN、Pendleton）到具体的给予与接收技巧，再到 Kim Scott 的极度坦诚实践。三篇文档构成递进关系——先理解\"用什么结构说\"，再掌握\"怎么说和怎么听\"，最后内化\"以什么心态说\"。\n\n掌握本章内容后，你将具备在任何一对一或即时场景中交付高质量反馈的能力，为后续章节的持续反馈文化与绩效评估撰写打下基础。\n"}